          "heading": "Year Ended June 2025 versus June 2024",
          "excerpts": [
            {
              "source_id": "cba25:p031:b027",
              "quote": "Occupancy and equipment expenses decreased by $38 million or 4% to $957 million, primarily driven by exits from commercial and retail premises."
